                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "The Ministry of Health’s Drug Advisory Committee has not recommended ferric derisomaltose for inclusion on the MOH List of Subsidised Drugs for treating iron deficiency anaemia due to unfavourable cost-effectiveness compared with ferric carboxymaltose at the price proposed by the manufacturer."
